- **Operating cash flow**: only US$3.7 billion in FY2025, a 50% decrease from US$7.43 billion in FY2024

**Objective Assessment**: Nike is currently at a financial trough. The three core indicators of revenue, profit margin, and cash flow are all deteriorating. But it’s important to note whether this is a cyclical low or a structural recession – this is the core disagreement.

